@startuml
title stm — ExampleExplorer reading state
[*] --> Closed
Closed --> Open : activate opener / select first context, focus heading
state Open {
 [*] --> OtherContexts
 OtherContexts --> Deeper : activate deeper tab / select first sheet, reset scroll
 Deeper --> OtherContexts : activate contexts tab / select first sheet, reset scroll
 OtherContexts --> OtherContexts : select sheet / reset reading scroll
 Deeper --> Deeper : select sheet / reset reading scroll
}
Open --> Closed : Escape or close / restore opener focus and course position
@enduml
